== Notes ==

* Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* A character performing a whirlwind attack cannot be [[flank]]ed.
* It is not possible to execute a [[sneak attack]] or a [[death attack]] when using this feat.
* If whirlwind attack is used against exactly three targets, the attacker will lock up, becoming unable to attack or perform actions. This bug only occurs when the game ([[server]] in multiplayer) is running under Linux or the Mac operating system. (It had been a bug under Windows as well, but was fixed for that operating system.)
* Some multiplayer servers disable this feat because some builders believe it contributes to lag.

=== Previous versions ===

* Prior to version 1.69, the attacks were not made with the full base attack bonus; each successive attack had a cumulative -5 modifier to the attack bonus.

